## 2 · BIG DOMINO BD-1.AV-1 (this avatar's candidate — reconciled by 12 ASSEMBLE)

- **bd_statement:** "A store that gets several small, capped tries — products released in stages, each tested on an ad budget I approve, with an early review that swaps out what doesn't sell — is the key to having an income of my own that isn't hostage to a job."
- **md_id:** MD-01 (LB-MKT #1 ★, VALIDATED) · **lf8_root:** #1 survival / enjoyment of life (MD-01 top route, 5 anchors); AV-01 enters it through #3 freedom from fear — of losing again (Q-Y-0047 "pure loss of money of time of energy of honestly hope") · **desire_wording:** "I want to have an income that is my own" (08 T1) — AV-01's own words: "I'm looking for a steady income" (Q-O-0109 [R-OWNED])
- **mechanism_ref:** M-2 (UMS of LOCK-A MK-01) in plain words; rests on M-1 (the one-shot launch).
- **desire anchoring check (§6.2):** anchored to a leaderboard MD with an lf8_root → not a feature claim. AV-01 alternate anchor (for 12 to weigh): MD-04 "build something of my own — not the one who almost did" (CP-03 #1).

