| OBJ-03 this is probably a scam | T1 | NO | trust in the vendor, not in the method; PT-16 automated trust scores 0/100 and 25% |
| OBJ-07 how fast / how much / what's guaranteed | T1 | YES | believing the tries are the key turns "how much" into "how many tries" — the honest answer (PT-09) stops reading as evasion |
| OBJ-06 I don't have the time | T2 | YES | M-2 has the tries run and read by the service while he approves budgets (F-05) |
| OBJ-103 suppliers / shipping will sink it | T2 | NO | supplier failure is a different job (FS-06, MK-05) — staged tries give a fallback but not a checked supplier |
